WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:01:35.400
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:39.810
[Abyss]

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:45.400
Captain Xin.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:47.810
Xiaoliang is here.

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:52.280
Come here.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:01:59.450
Well...

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:01.940
I'll leave you two alone.

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:03.260
I'll get going.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:15.490
What is it now?

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:19.000
Mom asked me to bring you
some late-night snacks.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.460
She said she couldn't reach you
on the phone.

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:29.400
Just leave it there.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.360
Go home early if there's nothing else.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:33.420
I'm busy right now.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.640
[3/12 Case]

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:44.550
[Li Fang]

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:46.570
[Liu Xiaohua]

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:48.110
[3/12 Case]

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:50.340
[Du Juan]

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:52.030
Dad.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:54.710
Look at these cases.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.450
Once these people are caught,

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.240
are they as good as dead?

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:01.030
The law will judge them.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:02.770
My job

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:04.320
is to catch them

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:06.370
and bring them before the court.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.810
So, if a person—

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.470
a good person,

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.590
to help a friend,

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.800
accidentally did something wrong,

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.050
can he still be spared?

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.430
That depends on
whether it's a public security case

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.860
or a criminal case.

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:22.050
It's not really a case.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:25.560
Maybe he just lost his head for a moment
and had no choice.

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.610
What do you mean by having no choice?

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.550
Under the law,

00:03:29.579 --> 00:03:31.180
there is no such thing
as having no choice.

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:32.150
Making a mistake while helping a friend—

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.120
that's not a friend.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:34.170
That's an accomplice.

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.230
You don't have to yell. I can hear you.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:37.410
I left the food here.

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:38.300
Remember to eat it.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:39.230
I'm leaving now.

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:49.050
[Huangshui Public Security Bureau]

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:26.700
[Episode 5]

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:28.980
[Emergency]

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:37.070
[Huangshui County, 8 years ago, 2004]

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:44.150
Boss, you're finally here.

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:46.830
Boss, my wife is on the night shift today.

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.680
The kid is home alone.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:50.390
I've been feeling uneasy about it.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.770
-So I…
-Alright, alright!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.270
I know you're worried about
your little one.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:53.930
Go back now.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:55.220
W-Well then, thank you.

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.060
Thanks.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:01.210
Captain Xin.

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:03.810
What's the situation now?

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:05.480
The victim's name is Chen Chunli.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.510
Female, 37 years old.

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:07.430
No fixed occupation.

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:09.430
She's been selling fruit
at a stall for the past few months.

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:10.710
She was stabbed 3 times in the abdomen.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.970
Multiple abrasions all over her body.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.260
She crawled onto the highway,

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.650
was found by a truck driver,

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:15.860
and was sent to the hospital.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:17.370
She lost a lot of blood
and is still being resuscitated.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:18.450
Where is the driver?

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:19.270
At their station.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:20.770
Ready to be transferred at any time.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:21.310
Oh, right.

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:23.500
The emergency doctor
specifically mentioned

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:24.910
that the wounds are very unusual,

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.510
approximately triangular.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:35.650
This is the 5th case.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.940
If I can't catch them,

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.140
I've lived my life in vain.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.440
Have the victim's family been notified?

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:58.090
Yes, they have.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:05:59.290
They are on their way.

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:13.800
Xin.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:14.870
I know you're busy.

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:16.450
I'm not rushing you.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:19.350
It's just that...
Xiaoliang hasn't come back.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:21.940
I've looked for him.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.660
And I've called all his teachers.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:27.690
I'm just worried.

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:28.920
I'm scared.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.010
I'm afraid he got into trouble outside

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:33.340
and was taken to the police station again.

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:34.890
Can you ask your colleagues

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:36.930
if anyone has seen him tonight?

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:39.890
I'm too ashamed to ask.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.370
What does that mean?

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:44.690
Is he only my son?

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.860
Does he have nothing to do with you?

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.159
Are you going to do something?

00:06:48.159 --> 00:06:49.950
Look at the time!
Aren't you going to do something?

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:50.630
You find...

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:54.810
You're back?

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.570
Come on. Where have you been?

00:06:57.580 --> 00:06:58.500
Xin Xiaoliang!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:09.060
[Emergency]

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:10.900
I closed the stall late

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.600
last night,

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:17.710
so I missed the last bus.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:22.190
Of course I wouldn't splurge on a cab.

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:24.620
So I figured I'd just

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:28.040
walk back along that road.

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:32.299
That road was quite remote,

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:37.340
but usually there are cars passing by.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:39.950
Unexpectedly,

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:43.120
as I was walking...

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:08.080
H-Help!

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:17.220
Kill her!

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.310
I passed out

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:23.390
from the pain.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.340
They probably thought I was dead.

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:31.470
First, they took my bag.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:35.140
Then my wallet.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:38.240
And the gold ring

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:42.420
I always wore on this hand.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.530
Then they

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.630
walked away cursing.

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:51.590
I didn't dare to move.

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:54.620
And it took me a long time
to get over the pain.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.200
When it got quiet,

00:09:57.650 --> 00:09:59.000
I finally dared

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:02.440
to crawl toward...

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:05.530
toward the road

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:06.900
where I could see cars.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:08.990
Are you sure there were three of them?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:10.790
Yes.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.920
Did you get a clear look at their faces?

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:14.050
No.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.360
It was too dark.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:20.390
They all seemed to be wearing masks.

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:21.010
What about their voices?

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.460
Anything special about their voices?

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:24.050
Local accents or from out of town?

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:26.640
I didn't catch any accents.

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:28.340
But...

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:30.740
the one I-I hit

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:34.530
seemed a bit younger.

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:38.440
The other two were older.

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:40.380
One young, two older?

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:41.900
Can you be more specific?

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:46.440
The young one was in his early 20s.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.760
The older two

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:51.880
were in their 40s or 50s.

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:53.600
Weren't you with your son?

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:54.530
Where is he?

00:10:58.530 --> 00:10:59.740
My son

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.320
failed the college entrance exam 3 times.

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:06.600
I just sent him out of town a few days ago

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:09.370
to study at my brother's place.

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:12.280
But officer,

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:16.250
I don't want my son to know about this.

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:17.030
So...

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:20.500
What's wrong? Does it hurt?

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.590
I-I'll go call the doctor.

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:23.610
No, no need.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:25.030
Officer,

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.340
I'm sorry

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:30.090
I couldn't be of more help.

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:34.040
But I really can't take it anymore.

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:35.130
One last question.

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:36.680
The knife that stabbed you...

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.090
Come on. That's enough.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:43.790
She's in so much pain.

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:44.860
If y-you guys

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:46.340
have any other questions,

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:48.940
c-can't you come back a few days later?

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:51.250
Let her get some good rest.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:52.150
O-Okay?

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:55.480
How can we catch the suspects
without asking her questions?

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.350
Alright, focus on recovering for now.

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:05.900
We'll come back in a while.

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:20.710
[Operating Room]

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:23.060
[Room 03]

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:23.830
Zhao.

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:25.390
Captain Xin.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.270
Chen Chunli gave birth to Guo Pengfei
when she was 17.

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:29.120
Guo Pengfei's biological father

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.700
was about the same age as her.

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:32.220
He couldn't take responsibility.

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:34.150
He and his family moved to Fujian
over a decade ago,

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:35.480
and he hasn't come back since.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.360
Her current boyfriend is Chen Dingkun,

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.510
a teacher
at No. 3 Middle School of the county.

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:39.500
He's divorced.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:40.980
They started dating half a year ago

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:42.100
and moved in together
two and a half months ago.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.770
They reportedly have a good relationship.

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:45.440
He was on duty at school
during the incident,

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:46.700
so he can be ruled out.

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.340
Guo Pengfei failed
the college entrance exam

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:49.370
and is retaking it.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.250
A few days before the incident,

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:50.890
Chen Chunli sent him

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:53.020
to study at her cousin's place in Qidu.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.510
What about Chen Chunli's parents?

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:57.380
They died when she was very young.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.460
Chen Chunli grew up at her aunt's house

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:00.860
until she got pregnant out of wedlock.

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:01.860
Her aunt thought she was a disgrace,

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:03.130
kicked her out,

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:05.530
and they never contacted each other again.

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:09.550
She was just a teenager.

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:11.470
How did she raise her son alone?

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:12.960
Working odd jobs.

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.940
Just from the jobs we investigated,

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.740
she's done 7 or 8 different ones.

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:29.130
This area here.

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.270
And here.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:47.950
How many pieces so far?

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:53.960
Including your three,

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.080
36.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:03.610
Let's test the primary crime scene first
when we get back.

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:08.110
The blood by the road
should be the victim's.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:10.560
Surviving this much blood loss,

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:11.720
she's really tough.

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:12.970
Any other findings?

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.670
We also found this at the scene.

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:19.810
[Changle Condoms]

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.290
A condom wrapper?

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.180
A major breakthrough.

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.840
This is the first time we've found this

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:25.700
at a crime scene.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:26.360
Right.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:27.760
Changle brand?

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:28.360
[Changle Condoms]

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:29.790
This brand of condoms

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.130
isn't sold on the market.

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.150
It's distributed for free
by the Family Planning Commission

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:34.880
to the family planning offices
of various units.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.250
There are a lot of them,

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.700
and they have no special marks,

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:40.220
so they're hard to trace.

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:42.860
Let's see if we can find

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.520
any biological traces first.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:45.250
Okay.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.750
We found a used

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:47.890
[Changle Condoms]

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:49.830
Changle condom wrapper at the scene.

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:50.520
[No biological traces were recovered.]

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.600
However,

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:53.080
we didn't extract

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.960
any useful biological traces.

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:56.080
[The People's Police Serve the People]

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:56.840
We also tested

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:57.610
36 blood samples.

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:58.080
[Crime Scene Evidence]

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.150
After ruling out Chen Chunli's blood,

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:00.320
[Victim's Blood Type: O]
[Blood Test Result: AB]

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:01.460
we found a stone

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:02.840
with AB-type blood on it.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:05.530
This stone is most likely
the one Chen Chunli said

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:06.960
she used to fight back.

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:09.120
We used the DNA from the blood

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:11.250
and the skin flakes under the nails
of Liu Xiaohua,

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:13.650
the victim in the 3rd group
of the 3/12 Case,

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:14.840
to make a comparison.

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:15.670
They...

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.140
didn't match.

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:19.550
Since multiple clues

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:21.030
point to a three-person gang,

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:23.370
I think we have

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:25.070
the DNA of two of them.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:25.770
[Crime Scene Evidence]

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:26.790
You've already concluded

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:29.150
that Chen Chunli's case and the 3/12 Case

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.680
were committed
by the same group of suspects?

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:32.370
Yes.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.610
I don't think

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:34.890
we can rule out

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.600
the possibility of a copycat crime.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.020
The possibility of a copycat crime exists,

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.520
but it's very small.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:40.830
[Crime Scene Evidence]

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.230
There are 3 reasons.

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:42.950
First,

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:45.470
Huangshui has low population mobility.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.550
Second, the criminals' psychology.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.210
Third, the similarities
in the murder weapons.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:52.230
Now, let's assign tasks.

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:54.080
Fanjie and Wang, you each take a team,

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:55.050
work with the traffic police,

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.980
and check
all the major routes out of town,

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:59.000
highway exits, bus stations,
and train stations.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.820
Zhao Ganzhe and I will coordinate

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:02.840
with the local police stations
to check hospitals,

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:04.270
clinics, pharmacies, and hotels.

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.750
Judging from the amount of blood
on the stone,

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:07.620
the suspect must have
a large wound on his forehead.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:09.670
He definitely needs to get it treated.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:11.880
Let's try to catch him

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:12.980
within 24 hours.

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:13.910
Yes!

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:17.370
Go to the First Hospital first.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.830
I'll contact the police stations.

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:19.690
I can do that

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:20.760
by myself.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.100
You were working overtime
before Chen Chunli's incident.

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:23.810
Up to now,

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:25.440
you've been working for 40 hours straight

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:26.510
without rest.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:29.030
You should go home and sleep, you know?

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:30.620
The guys are all working.

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:32.350
You want the captain to go home?

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:33.860
You're human,

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:34.720
not Superman.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:35.770
If you drop dead from exhaustion,

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:37.310
I can't take the responsibility!

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:38.370
You're a detective.

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:40.360
Why are you afraid of everything?

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:42.290
Yes, I'm naturally timid.

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:44.120
Anyway, if you don't go back to rest,

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.320
I'll report it to the bureau leaders

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:46.520
and see what they say.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.980
Why don't you report it to the head
of the Public Security Department?

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.780
I don't have their phone number.

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:52.340
I'll kick...

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:55.890
Besides,

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:57.030
even if it's not for yourself,

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.630
at least do it for your child.

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:00.770
Yesterday,
your wife couldn't find Xiaoliang,

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.740
and she even called me.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:04.569
You can't always be busy with work.

00:17:04.569 --> 00:17:05.680
You have to spend time with your child.

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:06.550
Alright, alright.

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:07.609
Don't mention him.

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:09.740
He's no different from a punk.

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:11.589
I have to bail him out
of the police station all the time.

00:17:11.589 --> 00:17:12.829
His father is a cop.

00:17:12.829 --> 00:17:14.500
I can't afford to lose face like this.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.079
He's just a kid.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.849
That's how teenagers are.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.700
When you were his age,

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.869
you were much more annoying than him.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:23.550
I'm taking the car.

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:24.609
You can take a taxi.

00:17:25.589 --> 00:17:27.190
Call me if you need anything.

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:44.200
Not bad. You can even pull off combos.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:45.110
Come on.

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:46.290
Come out!

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:56.640
Come on.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:17:58.870
Come on.

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:00.170
Damn.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:01.550
You can even pull off combos.

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:03.080
Why didn't you go to school?

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:04.240
Come out!

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:09.760
Come out.

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:13.330
You scared me.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:14.880
Why didn't you go to school?

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:15.740
I asked for leave.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.670
Mom agreed before she went to work.

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:21.980
What are you doing?

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:22.900
How did you get this?

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:24.760
I fell while playing basketball.

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:26.380
When did it happen?

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:27.850
Yesterday.

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:29.590
Don't pretend to care about me.

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:31.030
You never ask about me.

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:33.320
Yesterday?

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:36.390
The one I-I hit

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:39.170
seemed a bit younger.

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:41.550
He was in his early 20s.

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:44.180
It hurts!

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:47.020
What are you doing?

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:49.510
Does this look like a fall?

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:51.740
Tell me,

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.140
how did this happen?

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:55.260
I was beaten up!

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:56.740
By whom? Where?

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:57.830
With what?

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:59.010
At the basketball court!
We got into a fight over the court!

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:00.380
Some guy I didn't know hit me
with a brick!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:01.720
Tell me the truth!

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:03.010
I am telling the truth!

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:04.640
Xin Jiran, I'm your son!

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:05.740
I'm not a criminal!

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.250
Why are you yelling at me?

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:14.680
What's your blood type?

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:17.700
What's my blood type?

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:18.680
You're my dad!

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:19.640
You don't know my blood type?

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:20.880
I'm asking you!

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:22.720
I don't know!

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:24.090
Go ask Mom!

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:07.260
Xin Xiaoliang.

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:08.140
Where are the things inside?

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.320
[Changle Condoms]

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:11.530
What things?

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:13.180
Why are a few missing?

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:14.380
Did you take them?

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.680
You should ask yourself.

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:19.750
Did you forget to restock
after using them?

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:20.410
I'm asking you!

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:20.780
[Changle Condoms]

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:22.490
Where are they?

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:28.000
Yes, I used them.

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:30.070
I blew them up like balloons.

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:31.270
I even put one on the door handle

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:32.150
downstairs.

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:33.090
Didn't you see it?

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:33.810
What?

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:34.960
Are you running low?

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.590
I'll go buy more for you, alright?

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:37.810
Or just don't buy them.

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.290
Give me a little brother or sister.

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:42.020
Anyway, one more or one less kid
in this family...

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:43.330
Xin Jiran!

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:52.740
Xin Xiaoliang.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.900
Before I come back,

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:57.240
don't you dare step out of this door.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:03.830
Try me!

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.450
We'll see about that!

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:15.640
I'm going out!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:17.160
Let go of me!

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:17.900
Let go of me!

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:19.160
Let... Let go of me!

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:19.920
Let go!

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.350
Let go of me, Xin Jiran!

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:23.270
Dad, Dad, Dad!

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:23.900
Dad, don't handcuff me!

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.110
Dad, Dad, Dad!

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:25.640
Dad, don't handcuff me!

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:27.080
Dad, Dad, Dad!

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:27.680
Dad!

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.160
Dad, I'm your son!

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.400
I... I'm not a criminal!

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.070
Why did you handcuff me?

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:33.000
Xin Jiran!

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.420
I'm going to call my mom

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:35.660
and tell her to divorce you,

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:38.120
so you'll be single
for the rest of your life!

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:40.820
You handcuffed me? I'm your son!

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:56.720
Luo.

00:21:57.350 --> 00:21:58.510
Here.

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:00.160
Why isn't it in a bag?

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:00.900
Don't ask so many questions.

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:01.610
Do it as fast as you can.

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:03.010
I'll wait in the hallway.

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:05.310
Okay.

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:23.590
[Devoted to Duty, Clean and Upright]

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:24.410
[Devoted to Duty, Clean and Upright]

00:24:28.570 --> 00:24:29.850
I have a folding bed in my office.

00:24:29.850 --> 00:24:31.270
Go in and get some sleep.

00:24:31.720 --> 00:24:32.470
No need.

00:24:33.040 --> 00:24:34.430
I'll just wait here for the results.

00:24:34.430 --> 00:24:36.030
The results are already out.

00:24:37.810 --> 00:24:38.980
So fast?

00:24:39.110 --> 00:24:40.980
You don't need a DNA test for this.

00:24:40.980 --> 00:24:42.900
Even the blood types don't match.

00:24:51.160 --> 00:24:52.500
Why do you look like

00:24:52.500 --> 00:24:54.180
you're relieved?

00:24:54.460 --> 00:24:56.460
Where did you get that gauze anyway?

00:24:58.570 --> 00:25:00.580
Don't ask if you see me as your brother.

00:25:00.580 --> 00:25:01.310
I'm leaving.

00:25:02.300 --> 00:25:04.250
I'll treat you to a meal some other day.

00:25:04.250 --> 00:25:06.770
Xin, take it easy!

00:25:28.070 --> 00:25:28.550
[Old-Fashioned
Fried Cakes and Sesame Balls]

00:25:28.550 --> 00:25:29.770
Well, I'll give you a bag.

00:25:29.770 --> 00:25:31.240
Choose for yourself, kid.

00:25:49.980 --> 00:25:50.900
Xin Xiaoliang.

00:25:51.310 --> 00:25:52.710
Xin Jiran made a mistake.

00:25:52.770 --> 00:25:53.980
I apologize to you.

00:25:59.820 --> 00:26:00.510
Xiaoliang!

00:26:12.720 --> 00:26:13.510
Xiaoliang?

00:26:13.920 --> 00:26:14.770
Xiaoliang?

00:26:14.880 --> 00:26:15.770
Xiaoliang!

00:26:24.700 --> 00:26:26.070
Xiaoliang, open your mouth.

00:26:26.070 --> 00:26:27.470
Come on, open your mouth.

00:26:27.840 --> 00:26:28.880
Open your mouth!

00:26:34.790 --> 00:26:35.610
Hello?

00:26:36.050 --> 00:26:38.880
Room 201, Unit 6, Building 6,
Jinhua Beili.

00:26:38.960 --> 00:26:40.250
A boy, 18 years old!

00:26:40.320 --> 00:26:41.900
It might be an asthma attack.

00:26:41.900 --> 00:26:43.140
He's not breathing!

00:26:43.160 --> 00:26:44.420
He's not breathing.

00:26:44.510 --> 00:26:45.510
Hurry, hurry!

00:26:45.550 --> 00:26:47.190
Please, hurry!

00:28:04.310 --> 00:28:07.220
[In Memoriam]

00:28:07.280 --> 00:28:14.940
[A Young Soul Leaves This World,
While Loving Hearts Weep Forever]

00:28:25.340 --> 00:28:27.100
Sorry, time's up.

00:28:27.120 --> 00:28:28.290
If you miss the time,

00:28:28.320 --> 00:28:30.180
you'll have to wait in line again.

00:28:33.050 --> 00:28:37.350
[In Memoriam]

00:29:03.960 --> 00:29:05.310
[A Young Soul Leaves This World,
While Loving Hearts Weep Forever]

00:29:05.400 --> 00:29:06.570
[In Memoriam]

00:29:18.370 --> 00:29:20.730
[A Young Soul Leaves This World,
While Loving Hearts Weep Forever]

00:29:43.810 --> 00:29:45.710
[A Young Soul Leaves This World,
While Loving Hearts Weep Forever]

00:30:24.370 --> 00:30:30.890
[In Memoriam]

00:33:56.840 --> 00:33:59.190
[Serve the People]

00:34:24.489 --> 00:34:26.020
I am guilty.

00:34:27.600 --> 00:34:29.080
I'm turning myself in.

00:34:41.960 --> 00:34:44.300
I spent 6 years in prison.

00:34:45.920 --> 00:34:47.050
For the past 6 years,

00:34:48.280 --> 00:34:50.480
I've been thinking about one question—

00:34:52.000 --> 00:34:54.170
what's the meaning of my life?

00:34:57.390 --> 00:34:59.160
Why don't I just die?

00:35:05.610 --> 00:35:07.050
There is only one answer—

00:35:08.780 --> 00:35:10.860
if the 3/12 Case is not solved,

00:35:12.620 --> 00:35:14.470
I won't be able to rest in peace.

00:35:20.340 --> 00:35:21.760
You asked me

00:35:22.450 --> 00:35:25.110
why I didn't go to the police station
to explain.

00:35:26.850 --> 00:35:28.450
I'm not even afraid of death.

00:35:29.980 --> 00:35:32.510
Why would I be afraid
of being misunderstood?

00:35:34.110 --> 00:35:35.240
Some things

00:35:36.400 --> 00:35:38.000
are as important as life.

00:35:38.460 --> 00:35:39.190
What things?

00:35:44.860 --> 00:35:45.760
Ideals?

00:35:47.360 --> 00:35:48.280
Faith?

00:35:50.920 --> 00:35:51.760
Reputation?

00:35:53.610 --> 00:35:55.380
I have none of those.

00:35:58.670 --> 00:36:01.800
I am a reckless man who caused
his whole family's deaths.

00:36:02.130 --> 00:36:03.410
I even feel that

00:36:04.280 --> 00:36:06.210
if I die on the street tomorrow,

00:36:08.320 --> 00:36:10.420
no one will shed a tear for me.

00:36:10.760 --> 00:36:11.800
You're wrong.

00:36:11.900 --> 00:36:14.090
You used to be a good cop.

00:36:14.360 --> 00:36:15.670
The people you helped

00:36:15.890 --> 00:36:17.080
will remember you.

00:36:24.870 --> 00:36:26.590
Fresh graduates

00:36:28.150 --> 00:36:29.330
are just naive.

00:36:32.300 --> 00:36:33.760
I don't think so.

00:36:39.770 --> 00:36:41.920
I graduated from the police academy
20 years ago

00:36:41.920 --> 00:36:43.730
I agree with Li Cheng.

00:36:44.130 --> 00:36:45.000
So,

00:36:45.560 --> 00:36:47.360
you must not be here to arrest me.

00:36:48.030 --> 00:36:49.340
You old bastard.

00:36:49.410 --> 00:36:51.090
You're pretty quick.

00:36:51.790 --> 00:36:53.840
What's the point of talking back to me?

00:36:53.840 --> 00:36:55.570
Let's go. Come back with me.

00:36:55.940 --> 00:36:57.760
Explain the situation clearly.

00:36:57.760 --> 00:36:59.360
Don't complicate the case.

00:36:59.360 --> 00:37:00.210
Wait. Can you guarantee

00:37:00.210 --> 00:37:01.460
I'll be out in 24 hours?

00:37:01.460 --> 00:37:02.150
I can't.

00:37:03.400 --> 00:37:04.610
But I can tell you

00:37:04.610 --> 00:37:06.190
the latest news.

00:37:08.440 --> 00:37:10.320
The 3/12 Case has been reopened.

00:37:10.720 --> 00:37:12.910
Our chance has come.

00:37:15.350 --> 00:37:16.470
Officially reopened?

00:37:16.470 --> 00:37:17.410
Not yet.

00:37:17.440 --> 00:37:18.970
It'll happen in a day or two.

00:37:21.130 --> 00:37:23.160
Did you find clues

00:37:23.190 --> 00:37:24.410
on Song Laifu?

00:37:30.650 --> 00:37:31.630
Chief Tu.

00:37:32.690 --> 00:37:34.760
The DNA comparison results confirm

00:37:35.460 --> 00:37:37.050
that before his death, Song Laifu

00:37:37.050 --> 00:37:38.570
had a direct conflict

00:37:38.570 --> 00:37:41.050
with one of the suspects at large

00:37:41.070 --> 00:37:42.630
in the 3/12 Case.

00:37:43.170 --> 00:37:45.000
This indicates that the two cases
are highly related.

00:37:45.000 --> 00:37:47.380
I suggest reopening the 3/12 Case

00:37:47.400 --> 00:37:49.800
and investigating the two cases together.

00:37:49.840 --> 00:37:51.070
I personally agree.

00:37:52.110 --> 00:37:52.730
First thing tomorrow morning,

00:37:52.730 --> 00:37:54.800
I will report to Chief Qi in person.

00:37:54.900 --> 00:37:55.670
Alright, Chief Tu.

00:37:55.670 --> 00:37:57.320
Then I'll continue to investigate

00:37:57.320 --> 00:37:59.650
Song Laifu's movements before his death.

00:38:02.450 --> 00:38:03.370
Xin Jiran—

00:38:04.130 --> 00:38:05.190
have you found him?

00:38:05.820 --> 00:38:06.610
Not yet.

00:38:07.840 --> 00:38:09.940
Since the blood on Song Laifu's stick

00:38:09.960 --> 00:38:11.290
wasn't Xin Jiran's,

00:38:12.150 --> 00:38:14.480
does that make him less of a suspect?

00:38:15.530 --> 00:38:16.350
Chief Tu,

00:38:17.050 --> 00:38:18.580
before Song Laifu died,

00:38:18.690 --> 00:38:21.050
he had a conflict with a suspect

00:38:21.050 --> 00:38:22.200
in the 3/12 Case.

00:38:22.470 --> 00:38:23.840
This doesn't contradict the possibility

00:38:23.840 --> 00:38:25.900
that Xin Jiran

00:38:25.900 --> 00:38:26.960
killed Song Laifu.

00:38:27.460 --> 00:38:28.720
Based on the evidence,

00:38:29.480 --> 00:38:30.250
I think

00:38:30.280 --> 00:38:32.690
Xin Jiran is still the prime suspect.

00:38:34.260 --> 00:38:36.260
The blood on Song Laifu's stick

00:38:38.090 --> 00:38:40.220
belongs to one of the three murderers?

00:38:40.260 --> 00:38:41.980
As soon as Luo Jinsong got the results,

00:38:41.980 --> 00:38:43.510
he messaged me,

00:38:43.670 --> 00:38:47.070
hoping I'd bring you back to the station
to prove your innocence.

00:38:47.070 --> 00:38:49.000
Someone as cautious as him

00:38:49.000 --> 00:38:51.000
broke the rules for you.

00:38:51.340 --> 00:38:54.340
And you said you'd die on the street
with no one caring?

00:38:54.820 --> 00:38:56.300
What do you take

00:38:56.300 --> 00:38:57.510
us old guys for?

00:38:57.660 --> 00:38:58.610
I'm telling you,

00:38:58.630 --> 00:39:00.460
even Fanjie,

00:39:01.260 --> 00:39:02.360
who may chew you out,

00:39:02.360 --> 00:39:04.230
might still want to help you deep down.

00:39:04.230 --> 00:39:05.340
What you guys think doesn't matter.

00:39:05.340 --> 00:39:07.140
I just want to solve the case now.

00:39:11.510 --> 00:39:13.130
Of the two suspects at large,

00:39:13.190 --> 00:39:14.210
could Song Laifu be

00:39:14.210 --> 00:39:15.940
the one without a DNA record?

00:39:20.590 --> 00:39:21.860
Could he and Bi Dehua

00:39:22.760 --> 00:39:24.500
both have been silenced
by the third person?

00:39:24.500 --> 00:39:26.050
Alright, alright, alright.

00:39:26.050 --> 00:39:27.050
Come back with me,

00:39:27.420 --> 00:39:28.880
prove your innocence,

00:39:28.880 --> 00:39:30.050
and continue investigating
after you're out.

00:39:30.050 --> 00:39:30.610
Come on.

00:39:31.880 --> 00:39:34.650
No need to take out the handcuffs, right?

00:39:34.780 --> 00:39:36.280
I don't even ha—

00:39:40.620 --> 00:39:41.830
You old bastard.

00:39:48.090 --> 00:39:51.750
It's okay if you don't trust Fanjie,
but you don't trust me either?

00:39:53.050 --> 00:39:53.980
Where's the car?

00:39:54.560 --> 00:39:55.770
Right at the door.

00:40:05.660 --> 00:40:06.540
Stop!

00:40:06.850 --> 00:40:08.870
Old bastard, stop right there!

00:40:12.050 --> 00:40:13.510
You went back on your word!

00:40:15.110 --> 00:40:15.820
Stop!

00:40:31.580 --> 00:40:32.340
Come on!

00:40:32.600 --> 00:40:33.480
Old Foodie!

00:40:35.420 --> 00:40:36.270
Old...

00:40:48.950 --> 00:40:50.830
Old Foodie, you don't

00:40:51.250 --> 00:40:52.310
have much stamina!

00:40:52.550 --> 00:40:53.630
Old bastard.

00:40:54.000 --> 00:40:55.420
If you want to run, then run.

00:40:55.420 --> 00:40:57.610
Why did you stop to mock me?

00:40:59.670 --> 00:41:00.900
You can outrun me.

00:41:01.730 --> 00:41:02.960
Can you outrun Li Cheng?

00:41:02.960 --> 00:41:04.290
Li Cheng, hold him down!

00:41:04.300 --> 00:41:05.530
He's on my side!

00:41:06.500 --> 00:41:08.320
I'm not an official police officer yet.

00:41:08.320 --> 00:41:09.320
I have no law enforcement powers.

00:41:09.320 --> 00:41:10.710
I can't hold him down.

00:41:10.880 --> 00:41:11.820
You brat.

00:41:11.870 --> 00:41:13.930
Now you are following the rules, huh?

00:41:14.450 --> 00:41:15.120
Zhao!

00:41:15.980 --> 00:41:17.360
The three of us—

00:41:17.380 --> 00:41:18.570
with you in the light, me in the dark,

00:41:18.570 --> 00:41:19.280
and Li Cheng in the middle—

00:41:19.280 --> 00:41:20.380
we make a pretty good team.

00:41:20.380 --> 00:41:21.860
I'm not afraid to tell you

00:41:21.930 --> 00:41:23.650
that I plan to go to Xidu

00:41:23.940 --> 00:41:25.330
and verify once again

00:41:25.360 --> 00:41:28.030
whether Song Laifu
ever returned to Huangshui

00:41:28.050 --> 00:41:29.770
while he was working there 8 years ago,

00:41:29.770 --> 00:41:31.480
and whether he had time
to commit the crime.

00:41:31.480 --> 00:41:34.300
For an inter-provincial investigation
into a case

00:41:34.300 --> 00:41:36.440
from so many years ago,
you know how long it takes

00:41:36.440 --> 00:41:38.040
through official channels.

00:41:39.030 --> 00:41:40.290
Leave it to me,

00:41:40.580 --> 00:41:41.760
and it'll be much faster!

00:41:41.760 --> 00:41:42.670
Don't think

00:41:42.670 --> 00:41:45.030
just because the blood on the stick
isn't yours,

00:41:45.030 --> 00:41:46.860
Fanjie will give up looking for you!

00:41:46.860 --> 00:41:48.180
Then let him.

00:41:50.360 --> 00:41:51.010
Li Cheng.

00:41:53.260 --> 00:41:54.390
Let's keep in touch.

00:41:56.280 --> 00:41:56.900
Bro.

00:41:58.340 --> 00:41:59.200
I'm sorry.

00:42:07.170 --> 00:42:08.700
Should we keep chasing him?

00:42:16.880 --> 00:42:18.810
Why did Song Laifu come here?

00:42:18.900 --> 00:42:20.610
Maybe he was meeting someone?

00:42:20.860 --> 00:42:23.030
Or maybe he hid something here.

00:42:23.800 --> 00:42:24.730
Didn't you say

00:42:24.730 --> 00:42:26.110
you saw a photo
with about half of it torn off

00:42:26.110 --> 00:42:27.970
at Han Pinmu's place?

00:42:28.110 --> 00:42:30.590
Does the background match this part?